{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "0f0e6bb6-34a5-8c67-ac29-b2ce4196c5f9",
  "created_at": "2026-02-04T13:28:10-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Rosa Herrera",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:23:11-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:23:16-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, Kevin. Yes, good afternoon. My name is Rosa Herrera. I am calling because the truck broke my trash bin this morning. The garbage truck."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:23:26-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, okay. Broke it how? Like the lid, the wheels, the whole thing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:23:32-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The lid, it is cracked all the way, and one side is, how do you say, smashed in. The arm of the truck took it and it dropped hard on the street. Now the lid does not close. I am not happy about this, I tell you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:23:50-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, no, that's no good. Let me get some details down. What's the address there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:23:57-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "478 Ruggles Avenue. In Historic Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:24:00-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four seventy-eight Ruggles. Got it. And was this the regular trash day today, Wednesday?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:24:06-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, Wednesday is my day. I put the bin at the curb last night, very nicely, with the handle facing the house like they ask. This morning I come out and it is lying on the side with the lid broken."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:24:22-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So, bin damaged by the truck during pickup, Wednesday morning. Is it the trash bin or the recycling one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:24:30-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The trash one. The big green one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:24:34-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Green, trash, cracked lid, side caved in. Writing that down. Is it still usable, or is it leaking, falling apart?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:24:42-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can use it, but the lid is open, so the wind and the animals, you know. I put a rock on it for now. It is not a solution."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:24:54-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, right. No, a rock's not going to cut it for long."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:24:59-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Exactly. So I want to ask, is there a fee? For a new one? Because it is not my fault. I did not break it. The truck broke it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:25:11-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fair question. Generally if the truck damages it during collection, the city handles the replacement, so that wouldn't be on you. I'll put it in as crew damage. If anything about a charge comes up, they'd tell you before, not after."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:25:27-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Because if I must pay for something the city broke, I will be very, how you say, upset. I already pay my taxes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:25:37-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll note on the request that you were asking about that, so whoever follows up knows."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:25:44-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. And how long will it take? Because tomorrow I need to, hold on, [pause] sorry, I have a thing on the stove. Okay. Tomorrow I have a party in my daughter's classroom, and I have to bring things, and I do not want to carry trash out of my kitchen in a bag with no bin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:26:07-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A classroom party, nice. What are you bringing, cupcakes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:26:11-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The teacher sent a note only for napkins. Napkins, and nothing else. So I have to buy napkins, a big pack, and I forget until now because of this bin. It is a small thing but it adds up, you know."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:26:27-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, it all piles up. Well, for the bin, I can't promise you a day. Usually the crew drops off a replacement within a few days to a week, depending on how backed up they are. Do you have a spare container, even a big barrel or something, for the meantime?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:26:47-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I have a plastic barrel in the garage, I can use it. But the truck will not take a barrel, no?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:26:56-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Next pickup's a week out, so you've got time. Hopefully the new bin's there before then. If not, give us a call back and we'll sort out what to do with that week's trash."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:27:10-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. That is fine. I only want it fixed and not to pay. That is all."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:27:17-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Totally reasonable. Let me read it back. Rosa Herrera, 478 Ruggles Avenue, green trash bin, lid cracked and side crushed by the truck during Wednesday pickup, replacement requested, caller asking about any fee. Sound right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:27:31-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that is right. Exactly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:27:34-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And the best number to reach you, in case the crew has a question?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:27:40-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0150. It is the house phone. If I do not answer, leave a message, I will call back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:27:48-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four oh one, five five five, oh one five oh. Perfect."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:27:53-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Kevin. I hope the new one comes soon, because the rock is already tired."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:28:00-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll pass that along. Have a good rest of your day, Ms. Herrera, and good luck with the napkins."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:28:08-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
